:[{"name":"Skill Summary - 3","quantity":4},{"name":"Orirock Concentration","quantity":2},{"name":"Grindstone Pentahydrate","quantity":3}],"m3":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 3","quantity":6},{"name":"Polymerization Preparation","quantity":2},{"name":"Optimized Device","quantity":2}]},"pairings":[],"techniques":[]}],"skillCost":{"2":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 1","quantity":2}],"3":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 1","quantity":2},{"name":"Ester","quantity":4}],"4":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 2","quantity":3},{"name":"Oriron","quantity":2}],"5":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 2","quantity":3},{"name":"Polyketon","quantity":2}],"6":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 2","quantity":3},{"name":"Integrated Device","quantity":2}],"7":[{"name":"Skill Summary - 3","quantity":4},{"name":"Loxic Kohl","quantity":3}]}},"baseSkills":[{"name":"Clue Search β","facility":"Reception Room","eliteLevel":"Base","description":"When this Operator is assigned to the Reception Room, Clue search speed increases by 20%"},{"name":"Royal Detective (Self Proclaimed)","facility":"Reception Room","eliteLevel":"Elite 1","description":"When this Operator is assigned to the Reception Room, the likelihood of obtaining Penguin Logistics clues is increased (working time improves the likelihood)."}],"modules":[{"type":"Original","name":"May's Badge","stages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"MAR-X: Novice Detective's Gift Bag","mission":{"requirement1":"During battle, have May use Binding Shock a total of 5 times (excluding Support Units)","requirement2":"Clear Main Theme 4-4 with a 3-star rating; You must deploy your own May, and cannot include any other Sniper Operators as members"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"ATK +18 , ASPD +1","effectLabel":"New trait","effectText":"Increases ATK to 110% when attacking aerial targets","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Integrated Device","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":20000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"ATK +23 , ASPD +2","effectLabel":"Victorian Agent improved","effectText":"ATK +10%, ASPD +7","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":15},{"name":"Semi-Synthetic Solvent","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":25000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"ATK +27 , ASPD +3","effectLabel":"Victorian Agent improved","effectText":"ATK +12%, ASPD +7","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":1},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":5},{"name":"RMA70-12","quantity":6},{"name":"LMD","quantity":30000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"Claims to be a\nVictorian\nRoyal Detective; claims to have cracked a number of cases, and thus has gained some fame; claims to have been dispatched to\nRhodes Island\non high recommendations from her boss.\nRegardless of what she claims to be, Ms. May is now serving Rhodes Island as a\nsniper\n.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":45,"base":{"hp":730,"atk":163,"def":36,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":10,"block":1,"interval":1},"max":{"hp":1043,"atk":273,"def":61,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":10,"block":1,"interval":1},"rangeId":"3-1"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":60,"base":{"hp":1043,"atk":273,"def":61,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":12,"block":1,"interval":1},"max":{"hp":1338,"atk":391,"def":88,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":12,"block":1,"interval":1},"rangeId":"3-3"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":1338,"atk":391,"def":88,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":12,"block":1,"interval":1},"max":{"hp":1632,"atk":478,"def":105,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":12,"block":1,"interval":1},"rangeId":"3-3"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":65,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there are no other signs of infection. At this time, this operator can be confirmed to be uninfected.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0%\nOperator May shows no signs of Oripathy infection.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.13u/L\nOperator May sometimes comes in contact with Originium in the field, but this has not affected her health for the time being.\n\nUnexpectedly, she is not as rash as she appears. Little Ms. Detective will take proper protective measures before entering potentially dangerous locations according to basic protocols taught in school. It is good to see that they are effective.\n--Gavial, Medic Operator"},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"A self-proclaimed detective who appears to be rash and impetuous.\nEven though she does exhibit some detective literacy, most likely having received professional training in investigation, tracking, counter-tracking, clue analysis, etc, she also emits an aura of unreliability, which can be a blessing in a sense.\nThough her performance in minor, day-to-day matters leaves much to be desired, she always steps up in critical moments and demonstrates her trustworthiness as a detective."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Ms. May seems to be excessively concerned about Penguin Logistics, and often attempts to approach Exusiai and other staff members to ask questions about the internal operations of Penguin Logistics.\nMs. Croissant seems to welcome this development, and has even established a fee schedule for her information. It is unknown whether Ms. May actually pays this intelligence fee, but she claims to have received 'valuable intel' from 'enthusiastic Operators' such as Exusiai and others, including but not limited to the following:\n1. Penguin Logistics is actually a food distribution company specializing in apple pie.\n2. Penguin Logistics is actually an idol group that performs part-time courier services.\n3. The boss of Penguin Logistics is actually a plushie toy. \n4. Penguin Logistics rarely takes time off, but overtime pays very generously. \n......\n\nIt's hard to say whether Ms. May believes this information."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Indeed, Ms. May's oral resume is fabricated. \nAccording to subsequent investigations, Victoria does not have the position of 'Royal Detective,' and Ms. May herself is not a member of any official Victorian institution. Her real purpose in approaching Rhodes Island seems to be investigating Penguin Logistics. \nEven though she acts as if her cover story is foolproof and when pressed upon the matter repeatedly, reiterates it as if buying into her own story, she compromised her own story even early in the interview process.\nDue to her pitiably clumsy acting, one cannot help but to feel sorry for her. With Dr. Kal'tsit's consent, she was allowed to act freely under the condition that she would not do anything to undermine Rhodes Island's interests. After all, no matter how you look at it, she's far from discovering anything resembling the truth about Penguin Logistics."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"Ms. May's love for the detective profession is true.\nShe is descended from a famous family of detectives. She received an upbringing that nurtured this ever since she was a child. In her room are a large number of cop movies and various detective props. If you entered her room without knowing better, you might be led to believe that you just barged into a tough guy's room.\nThough Ms. May's performance still has much room for improvement, her dedication to the pursuit of truth deserves recognition."},{"section":"Promotion Record","unlock":"Unlocked at E2","description":"Though she wouldn't admit it, Ms. May's joy upon receiving a promotion was almost palpable.\nAs long as she's been here, Ms. May has demonstrated confidence and optimism well beyond that of ordinary people, quickly adjusting her mentality in the face of whatever setback or failure she may have encountered. Outside evaluations also seem to have little effect upon her determination to pursue her goals. Nevertheless, in her mind, having her abilities be recognized by others may be the first step towards becoming a big detective."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/May%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/May%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/May%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/May%20-%20Elite%202.webp"},{"label":"Summer Flowers FA054","iconPath":"/four-star-icons/May%20-%20Summer%20Flowers%20FA054.webp","fullPath":"/four-star-skins/May%20-%20Summer%20Flowers%20FA054.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{"Summer Flowers FA054":"18 OP"},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Sniper","type":"class","entries":[{"operatorName":"Archetto","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Archetto%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"Every 2.5 seconds when deployed, restores 1 Skill Point to all deployed Sniper allies that have an Offensive Recovery skill.","matchedKeyword":"Sniper"}]},{"operatorName":"Ch'en the Holungday","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Ch'en%20the%20Holungday%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"When deployed, Ch'en's ammo-based skills have a 22% (+2%) chance to not consume the corresponding ammo for each shot; Other Sniper Operators' ammo-based skills have a 10% chance instead (only the highest effect of this type will be applied)","matchedKeyword":"Sniper"}]},{"operatorName":"Schwarz","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Schwarz%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T3","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T3","sourceText":"When Schwarz and at least o